5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe we should look at the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I would like to examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi! I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical start. I shall review the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
